   "t": "h2",
   "html": "The go-find metaldetector is it any good"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "on test for <a href=\"@minelab-manticore/\" data-kind=\"internal\">minelab</a> and <a href=\"http://www.crawfordsmd.com\" data-kind=\"affiliate\">Crawfords metal detecting store</a>. This is a prototype model and doesn't have the Bluetooth feature enabled. There will be 3 in the range and are superb entry level machines. From what I've already tested this is going to be a great machine,quick recovery and discrimination is pretty swift. It has L.E.D display and coloured lights to help with identifying good targets and iron. Looking forward to getting this out and hopefully will be a great review. Have a great weekend and happy hunting"
